Phase 1 Development  - Single Segment Path + Motion Profile + Drive controller
1. DriveSystem Structure - Single Path
Notice the folder names are simple English words that are easy for students to recognize:

DriveSystem – everything related to automated driving
Path – where to drive
Profile – how fast to drive
PID – how to correct errors
Utilities – shared helper functions

DriveSystem/
│
├── DriveMotionController.java      <-- Main controller
│
├── Path/
│   ├── DrivePath.java
│   ├── DrivePathState.java
│   ├── StraightLinePath.java
│   ├── CubicBezierPath.java
│   └── MultiSegmentPath.java
│
├── Profile/
│   ├── MotionProfile.java
│   ├── MotionState.java
│   ├── TrapezoidalProfile.java
│   └── SCurveProfile.java
│
├── FEEDforward/
│   └── FeedforwardCalculator.java
│── Tuning/
│   └── DriveFeedforwardTuner.java
|   └── FeedforwardPlotGenerator.java
│
└── Utilities/
    ├── MotionMath.java
    └── AngleUtil.java

The drivesystem is acutally coordinating:
    * Motion profile
    * Feedforward
    * PID feedback
    * Path following
    * Coordinate transforms
    * Mecanum kinematics
    * Voltage compensation
    * Completion detection
    * Cancellation logic

