4. Code Logic
    * DrivePath is interface force other implements need to have the method defined in
      the DrivePath interface
      an interface does not implement the method. It only declares that the method exists.

    * DrivePathState is the state of the path data container object providing the path information
      package storage.

    ┌───────────────────────────────┐
    │ DrivePathState                │
    │-------------------------------│
    │ distanceAlongPathMM = 400     │
    │ xMM = 825                     │
    │ yMM = 510                     │
    │ tangentX = 0.82               │
    │ tangentY = 0.57               │
    │ curvature = 0                 │
    └───────────────────────────────┘

    * StraightlinePath is the implementation of the DrivePath interface
    * CubicBezierPath is the implementation of the DrivePath interface
    * both implementations are forced to have the same method defined in the interface

                DrivePath (interface) - contrains  "DrivePathState" method
                          │
           "Every path must return a DrivePathState"
                          │
              ┌───────────┴───────────┐
              │                       │
      StraightLinePath         CubicBezierPath
              │                       │
              │ return                │ return
              ▼                       ▼
                DrivePathState
                      │
                      ▼
            DriveMotionController

5. Motion Profile
    * MotionState is the data container object returned by every motion-profile implementation.

    * MotionProfile is the interface that future profiles such as TrapezoidalProfile and SCurveProfile will implement.

    MotionState:
        Time
         ↓
        MotionProfile
         ↓
        MotionState: distance, velocity, acceleration
         ↓
        DrivePath
         ↓
        DrivePathState: X, Y, tangent, curvature


6. Architecture:
                Motion Profile
                --------------
                Input : Time
                Output: MotionState

                MotionState
                -----------
                Distance Along Path
                Velocity
                Acceleration

                    ↓

                Drive Path
                ----------
                Input : Distance Along Path
                Output: DrivePathState

                DrivePathState
                --------------
                X
                Y
                Tangent
                Curvature

                    ↓

                Drive Controller
                ----------------
                Input:
                    MotionState
                    DrivePathState
                    Current Pinpoint Pose

                Output:
                    Mecanum Motor Powers

